{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Retro Analog Camera 是一款主打復古底片質感的攝影 App，適合喜歡懷舊風格、鮮明色彩，並希望記錄生活片段的使用者。無論是派對、夜遊、演唱會、旅行或日常瞬間，都能套用不同風格拍攝。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/50/e0/79/50e079a2-b800-9ed5-9370-244b92eb09a8/Placeholder.mill/460x460Icon.ApSiOS01-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/50/e0/79/50e079a2-b800-9ed5-9370-244b92eb09a8/Placeholder.mill/460x460Icon.ApSiOS01-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/></p>\n<h2>打造個人復古視覺風格</h2>\n<p>在派對、夜遊或旅行途中，隨手一拍即可套用多種復古風格，為日常場景添上獨特視覺氣氛。你可以不斷嘗試不同拍攝風格，慢慢發展屬於自己的美學，並把值得記住的片段整理成個人視覺日記。App 設計簡潔，不設訂閱與廣告，支援離線使用，亦毋須註冊帳號，讓拍攝過程保持單純。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-237-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-238-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-239-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-240-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-241-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-242-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Retro Analog Camera</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/retro-analog-camera/id6828360771?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:17:36.852845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T15:58:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:18:08.591306+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:10:55.780278+00:00","content_hash":"eeb31805c3fb61b07ae7aedc7dbaffd545f90987444eb8d864987f9457c35497","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}